text.section:
A special court-martial shall have the authority to impose any of the following fines and penalties:

A fine of not more than $1,000;


Forfeiture of two-thirds pay per month for six months;


A reprimand;


Bad Conduct discharge;


Restriction to limits;


Imposition of extra duty;


Confinement for not more than three months;


Reduction of enlisted persons one or more pay grades; or


Any combination of these punishments.
